<title>Ecuador's security crisis: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ecuador/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ecuador-2026-11-22T16:30:00.040Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 16:30:00 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;US forces have begun their first land operation against cartels in Ecuador, while the United States also expands military activities across Latin America. Ecuadorian fishermen have sued the United States over a drone strike that sank their boat near the Galápagos, and President Noboa has asked the United States for $430.5 billion in security aid as Pete Hegseth meets him to discuss anti-narco cooperation. Prison gangs in Ecuador are sending bills to families of inmates, and Noboa has rejected claims that Jorge Glas was tortured, attributing his injuries to self-infliction. The UCDP counted two battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxQaVlsN2FuNE82VGp2ZXBmTF9Odkk0OU5waE5qUGdMZnRRNjRtQlVWaTg4encxV1NiMU9FTWh4TnVLc09DN1dLOWlRRHczUDBsWjEzdk9vdzY2N0VldVlXdTBSQXBha3pfb3RrMDE4LUctbHE4eWxxbXRLVktPM28wZlZrNWpQcVM1WHF0bEl4MXdpdTZONVBsUzkwMGxmRHFPNTBiaFQ1UDNKSjVkd2JqVlRqclkzUWVPX09qUGxn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxQYU0yT2dDTzZkYmtfLTJmSS1UZTNlc0cyWk1vZEpiM3JVNzFRaGdtMHNfNHpJUjRYaEJRU0p1OFlIb1RtU19rczlWclNCaGkxTVJaX2lybVFVa0pSc0stNVU2dFpaUHlMTWw0Y2R5c1d4SVVpS3NZdEY2X0RrWlNGdmJXVEtsSUdGSnJ4VWZEVjlHZHp5ckZkYU5vMDJpU0pnU1Z3?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxQR3MyOW9UX0RTY3ZRWjhxUFFCQldoNjFfc09ZV2FyVXItMi1hRnRoQWRDNGFwZE9EV0RZbDlHNFh0bGhrazdodjJLQ1ZEak94MnlSU3Z0a2ZYWDhVS2Z6SUJ5am5qQmhHNXd4VE1xX0R2RGFtYWo0NDh4bkVGR3h6Wm9GVm1PSzEtVExfcUgxM0xfLUU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Egypt Independent&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxOeFVSQ1FHXzUwcnNfZG50NVJIVFRkcHNZUmtmem1MU2ZKdUY4YlYwYWdxU3dWYWgyTXpWQjNvenRjenZlclZCQXBpV1B6YnBIRW1obHI3WkMxZDVhNGk4U3BkTVlIeHBxTkVsNmsxQ0ZKeG41N1RNe